\pard\keepn \fs36\cf1 \{bmc bm6.bmp\}   Blue LUT
\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par The display LUT comprises three LUTs, one for each colour gun in the display monitor (Red, Green, Blue).
\par 
\par In \b Blue LUT\plain\fs24  the red LUT is set to it's own pattern thus giving a palette from black (no colour) to peak Blue.
\par 
\par Changes in the LUT affect the blue colour only.
\par 
